{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/0797071/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここ!収録してきましたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回久々に乃木ここ!復活するからね。近日公開予定。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのことに挑戦してみて、お勉強になったなー感と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい気持ちで。うん幸せやよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり自分たちの番組をいただけるって本当にすごい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分たちが発言しないと番組が始まらないんですよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんそーゆーの積極的にできるタイプじゃないんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それじゃだめだわーって思いました。成長した!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近日から順次公開予定の乃木ここ。楽しみにしててくださいぬ(`・ω・')"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は鬼質問返し(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとつめのテーマは食べ物!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/0797071/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺、料理が趣味でパンとかも自分でオーブンで焼いたりして作ったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキとかも作るんだけどここまでやると引く?(ToT)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったくひかなーい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むしろかっこいいじゃあないですか。うん素敵(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん不器用なので料理とかほんとできないのよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから料理が得意な男性と一緒に暮らさないと餓死しちゃう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/0797071/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/0797071/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私パティシエールになるのが夢なんだけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんがこんなお菓子アレンジしてとかなんかある???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは食べるの専門だからなあ('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね。食べさせて?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/0797071/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのあかん飯なんかある??w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままが好きなのが「納豆アボカド丼」。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいやいや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"納豆もアボカドも好きくないのに、ふたつを混ぜたら完全アウトでしょ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思うんだけど、ままにはたまらなく美味しいそうです。すうも好きって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーわからん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/0797071/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久留米でとんこつラーメン食べたことあるかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーい('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久留米に行ったことないの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北九州止まり...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/0797071/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラーメンは何派?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前は俄然こってりした豚骨派だったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はあっさりしたやつの方が好みかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでかね。これが...老化...(;'∩`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/0797071/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スウィーツの中で特に好きなものとかある??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコレート!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あいすくりーむ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからだめなんだよね。重々わかっております。でも嫌いになんてなれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/0797071/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"牛丼屋さんは何処カナ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっかい松屋さんに行ってみたいのよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前まりか(伊藤万理華chan)あしゅ(齋藤飛鳥chan)と３人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"吉野家さーん行った!わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お腹空いたよねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超お腹空いたよねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはがっつり食べたいよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近くに吉野家さーんあるよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行くしか!みたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふたつめはふぁみりー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/0797071/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん家はＧＷは旅行とか行く派だったの!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっちゃい頃は遠くまでドライブ、去年までは地元のお祭り行ってたかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪のUSJとか、岡山のチボリ公園とか行ってました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/0797071/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉ちゃんってひめたんに似てる?(・ε・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似てないまったく!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と自分では思っとる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふとしたときの表情が似てるってすぅは言うけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全体的に雰囲気とかパーツとかなやっぱり似とらんはず(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/0797071/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉ちゃんは一般の方だよね(笑)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元で女子大生してますよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/0797071/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままのいない間のぱぱの食事がどうなってんのか気になる..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"姉さんが作ってくれてるみたいよーっ∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/0797071/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、すうちゃん、ままが上京してぱぱは寂しがってないですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しいんかなあ。寂しくしてると嬉しいなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく電話くれるよ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから久しぶりに広島帰ったとしても、あんま久しぶり感ないと思う!わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/0797071/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、失礼な質問ごめんね、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのぱぱさんってご健在ですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとおじいちゃん、おばあちゃんは?どうかな?(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげさまで元気ですよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配してくれてありがとうです(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すうのライブ見にたーまに東京きたりもしてくれるから、そんときに会えるの♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからもっともっとぱぱが東京に来てくれる機会が増えるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんも頑張ろうと思います(*^^*)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}